  "description": "ZUQKOP crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H88 N4 O32 Yb4 Zn2,C68 H88 N4 O32 Yb4 Zn2. From the CIF bond table, Yb01 (Yb) has 10 O neighbors; Yb03 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 10 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Yb02 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Yb04 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Yb7 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Yb8 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Zn4 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.491-4.209 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.39-115.39°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C68H88N4O32Yb4Zn2.",
